        "en": "Mosaic club session. To be admitted, a person must be between 16 and 80 years old, both inclusive, and be a resident, student or member, with at least one of those conditions. If under 18 years old, they additionally need guardian consent; adults do not need it. Registration is accepted from 2032-02-29T09:00:00.000Z, including that instant, until before 2032-03-01T09:00:00.000Z, excluding that final instant. For an admitted person only the first applicable rule is used, with this priority: if they have a scholarship, $0 USD; otherwise, if they are a student, $14 USD; otherwise, if they are a member and have guardian consent, $9 USD; otherwise, if they are a resident, $16 USD; in any other case, $31 USD. The scholarship does not remove admission requirements. Prices are not combined. There are no other admission conditions or deadlines.",
